Package: com.yoimdoingstuff.unified
Name: Unified
Version: 0.0.2
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Experimental. Adapts iPhone apps to iPad displays (and later the reverse). Settings > Unified lets you pick apps and modes; display adaptation itself is not implemented yet.
Maintainer: yoimdoingstuff
Author: yoimdoingstuff
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
